# "<repo-relative copy>|<repo-relative golden>"
# Each consuming tree holds its own copy, so its tests read nothing outside it.
# The .sha256 pins that sit beside a copy are compared too: a pin that drifts from
# the canonical one would let a stale copy pass its own pin test.
